  <description type="formattedtext">
    <p><b>Can of Coke</b></p>
    <p><i>Common consumable</i></p>
    <p>A bright red aluminum can filled with a dark, bubbling liquid. When opened, it gives off a sharp hiss and releases a burst of sweet caramel scent. Tiny bubbles cling to the rim, and the drink has a crisp, biting fizz. Though it looks strange compared to traditional potions, it is widely enjoyed by adventurers who need a quick mental pick-me-up.</p>
    <p>When consumed as an action, the drinker gains a +1 bonus to Perception checks for 1 hour.</p>
    <p>Some merchants market Can of Coke as an alchemical tonic, while others treat it as a novelty imported from a distant and mysterious land.</p>
  </description>
